OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order over gangs of
OL,4,A'intimidating' teens
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have brought in a dispersal
OL,7,Forder in a city suburb after reports of
OL,8,Flarge groups of teenagers setting off
OL,9,Ffireworks, fighting and intimidating
OL,10,Fresidents.
OL,12,FThe order in the Everton area of
OL,13,FLiverpool, which was initially brought
OL,14,Fin at 15:00 BST on Monday has been
OL,15,Ffurther extended until 17:00 on Friday.
OL,17,FNeighbourhood chief inspector Andrew
OL,18,FFielding said extra powers brought in
OL,19,Fthrough the dispersal order had helped
OL,20,Fto bring the situation under control.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
