OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order over gangs of
OL,4,A'intimidating' teens
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said officers had used 27 dispersals
OL,7,Fby Wednesday night and a 13-year-old
OL,8,Fboy from Liverpool was arrested on
OL,9,Fsuspicion of firework offences, with
OL,10,Fone breach of the dispersal order.
